# Playwright screenshots

Save Playwright screenshots with `playwrightArtifact` from `dqlrs-web/playwright/support/artifacts.js`.

```js
import { playwrightArtifact } from "../support/artifacts.js";

await page.screenshot({
  path: playwrightArtifact(`name-${testInfo.project.name}.png`),
});
```

Do not write a screenshot path under `/opt` or any other machine-specific directory. `playwrightArtifact` puts the file in `.playwright-artifacts` at the repository root.
